init-<TS>.log:Project settings (detected)
  test: blank — no test command found
  lint: blank — no linter found
  types: blank — no type checker found
  format: blank — no formatter found
  high-risk paths: blank — none set (all files light tier by path)
  isolation: export (from default)
    several coders share one checkout under export: a full test run sees their edits; set proof.isolation: worktree (one tree per block), or run gates run --run <r> --block <id> --changed for a block's own tests
  link dirs: blank — no dependency manifest found
  copy untracked: blank — none for this stack
Set the blanks later: edit .code-forge.yml (gates.test, gates.lint, gates.types, gates.format, proof.tiers.high.paths, proof.export.link_dirs, proof.export.copy_untracked), then run `code-forge validate`.
keys: jev from none
.code-forge.yml: changes review.multimodel, gates.types, gates.format, gates.ram_tmp, gates.ram_tmp_mb, gates.coder_test_parallel, project, provider, levels, caps, harnesses, system1, proof, autonomy, land, autopilot, release, human_check, rebase
.code-forge.yml: written
engine: auto
